<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#b5122b">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
  <title>Kölle, Team und Kölsch</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --red: #b5122b;
      --red-dark: #870b1e;
      --red-light: #fff0f2;
      --anthracite: #292b2f;
      --grey: #687078;
      --light-grey: #eef0f2;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --green: #157347;
      --green-light: #e8f6ee;
      --amber: #936000;
      --amber-light: #fff4d6;
      --blue: #23559c;
      --blue-light: #eaf2ff;
      --shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(30, 32, 35, 0.12);
      --radius: 20px;
      --focus: 0 0 0 4px rgba(181, 18, 43, 0.25);
      --safe-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      background: var(--light-grey);
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-width: 320px;
      color: var(--anthracite);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(181, 18, 43, 0.10), transparent 32rem),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #fafafa 0%, var(--light-grey) 100%);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    button,
    input,
    textarea {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button,
    input,
    textarea {
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    button {
      min-height: 48px;
      border: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 750;
      transition: transform 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease, background 150ms ease;
      touch-action: manipulation;
    }

    button:hover:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    button:active:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    button:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible,
    textarea:focus-visible,
    focus-visible {
      outline: none;
      box-shadow: var(--focus);
    }

    button:disabled {
      cursor: not-allowed;
      opacity: 0.58;
    }

    input,
    textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border: 2px solid #c7cbd0;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--anthracite);
      padding: 14px;
    }

    textarea {
      min-height: 112px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    input:focus,
    textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--red);
      outline: none;
    }

    .skip-link {
      position: absolute;
      top: -100px;
      left: 12px;
      z-index: 100;
      background: var(--anthracite);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
    }

    .skip-link:focus {
      top: 0;
    }

    .app-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(41, 43, 47, 0.12);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 920px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      border: 3px solid var(--red);
      border-radius: 50% 50% 44% 44%;
      position: relative;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .brand-mark::before,
    .brand-mark::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 5px;
      width: 5px;
      height: 20px;
      border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
      background: var(--red);
    }

    .brand-mark::before {
      left: 9px;
      transform: rotate(5deg);
    }

    .brand-mark::after {
      right: 9px;
      transform: rotate(-5deg);
    }

    .brand-text {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .brand-title {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.15;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .brand-subtitle {
      margin: 2px 0 0;
      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
    }

    .score-pill {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      min-width: 92px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--anthracite);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .score-pill span {
      color: #ffdce3;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    main {
      width: min(100% - 24px, 920px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 22px 0 calc(36px + var(--safe-bottom));
    }

    .progress-shell {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .progress-labels {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .progress-track {
      height: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #d7dade;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      width: 0;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: inherit;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red), #df4459);
      transition: width 300ms ease;
    }

    .screen {
      animation: enter 260ms ease both;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid rgba(41, 43, 47, 0.09);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: clamp(18px, 5vw, 34px);
    }

    .hero {
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      padding-top: clamp(26px, 7vw, 54px);
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -80px;
      right: -70px;
      width: 210px;
      height: 210px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--red-light);
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 35px;
      right: 28px;
      width: 45px;
      height: 72px;
      border: 5px solid rgba(181, 18, 43, 0.22);
      border-bottom: 0;
      border-radius: 30px 30px 0 0;
      transform: rotate(4deg);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--red);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: 0.09em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3 {
      line-height: 1.17;
    }

    h1 {
      position: relative;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 4.2rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 5vw, 2.35rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 1.12rem;
    }

    p {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .lead {
      position: relative;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 12px 0 20px;
      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 3.7vw, 1.25rem);
    }

    .privacy-note,
    .info-box {
      padding: 13px 15px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--light-grey);
      color: #444a50;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .station-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 22px 0;
    }

    .station-preview {
      min-height: 130px;
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #dee1e4;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #fafafa;
    }

    .station-number {
      display: inline-grid;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--red);
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .station-preview strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .station-preview small {
      color: var(--grey);
    }

    .button-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .button-row > button {
      flex: 1 1 170px;
    }

    .primary,
    .secondary,
    .ghost,
    .danger {
      padding: 12px 18px;
    }

    .primary {
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--red);
      box-shadow: 0 7px 16px rgba(181, 18, 43, 0.20);
    }

    .primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: var(--red-dark);
    }

    .secondary {
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--anthracite);
    }

    .ghost {
      border: 2px solid #c7cbd0;
      color: var(--anthracite);
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .danger {
      border: 2px solid var(--red);
      color: var(--red);
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .full {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .station-nav {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .station-tab {
      min-height: 52px;
      padding: 8px;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      color: var(--anthracite);
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 13px rgba(41, 43, 47, 0.07);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    .station-tab.active {
      border-color: var(--red);
      color: var(--red-dark);
      background: var(--red-light);
    }

    .station-tab.complete::after {
      content: " ✓";
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .station-tab.locked {
      opacity: 0.56;
    }

    .station-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .station-header .station-number {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      margin: 0;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .station-header p {
      margin: 3px 0 0;
      color: var(--grey);
    }

    .question-count {
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      color: var(--red);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .question-title {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 5vw, 1.9rem);
    }

    .options {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .option-button {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 56px;
      padding: 13px 15px;
      border: 2px solid #d6d9dd;
      color: var(--anthracite);
      background: var(--white);
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .option-button:hover:not(:disabled) {
      border-color: var(--red);
      background: var(--red-light);
    }

    .option-button.selected {
      border-color: var(--red);
      background: var(--red-light);
    }

    .option-button.correct {
      border-color: var(--green);
      background: var(--green-light);
    }

    .option-button.incorrect {
      border-color: var(--red);
      background: var(--red-light);
    }

    .feedback {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 15px;
      border-left: 5px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--blue-light);
    }

    .feedback.success {
      border-color: var(--green);
      background: var(--green-light);
    }

    .feedback.warning {
      border-color: var(--amber);
      background: var(--amber-light);
    }

    .feedback p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .error-message {
      min-height: 24px;
      margin: 7px 0 0;
      color: var(--red-dark);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .term-display,
    .pair-display,
    .statement-display {
      margin: 8px 0 18px;
      padding: clamp(18px, 6vw, 32px);
      border-radius: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--red-light);
      color: var(--red-dark);
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 7vw, 2.7rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .pair-display {
      background: var(--anthracite);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .statement-display {
      font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 5vw, 2rem);
    }

    .label {
      display: block;
      margin: 14px 0 7px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .mode-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .mode-card {
      padding: 20px;
      border: 2px solid #d8dade;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--white);
      text-align: left;
    }

    .mode-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--red);
      background: var(--red-light);
    }

    .mode-card strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    .name-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 9px;
    }

    .name-button {
      min-height: 52px;
      padding: 10px 6px;
      border: 2px solid #d6d9dd;
      color: var(--anthracite);
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .name-button.selected {
      border-color: var(--red);
      color: var(--red-dark);
      background: var(--red-light);
    }

    .summary-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .summary-box {
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--light-grey);
    }

    .summary-box strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .result-details {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .result-section {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 17px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #f6f7f8;
    }

    .result-section ul {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .vote-results {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .vote-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(72px, 0.8fr) 3fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .vote-track {
      height: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #dce0e3;
    }

    .vote-fill {
      height: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
      border-radius: inherit;
      background: var(--red);
    }

    .footer-actions {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding-bottom: var(--safe-bottom);
    }

    .sr-only {
      position: absolute !important;
      width: 1px !important;
      height: 1px !important;
      padding: 0 !important;
      margin: -1px !important;
      overflow: hidden !important;
      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0) !important;
      white-space: nowrap !important;
      border: 0 !important;
    }

    .hidden {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .confetti-layer {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      pointer-events: none;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .confetti {
      position: absolute;
      top: -20px;
      width: 10px;
      height: 17px;
      opacity: 0.92;
      animation: fall 2.8s linear forwards;
    }

    @keyframes enter {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(8px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes fall {
      to {
        transform: translate3d(var(--drift), 110vh, 0) rotate(720deg);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 660px) {
      main {
        width: min(100% - 16px, 920px);
        padding-top: 14px;
      }

      .station-list,
      .summary-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .station-preview {
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .mode-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .name-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .brand-subtitle {
        display: none;
      }

      .station-tab {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 380px) {
      .header-inner {
        padding-inline: 10px;
      }

      .brand-title {
        max-width: 150px;
      }

      .score-pill {
        min-width: 82px;
        padding-inline: 9px;
        font-size: 0.84rem;
      }

      .station-tab {
        padding-inline: 3px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 17px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }

      .confetti-layer {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#quiz-root">Direkt zum Quiz</a>

  <header class="app-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <div class="brand" aria-label="Kölle, Team und Kölsch">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="brand-text">
          <p class="brand-title"><strong>Kölle, Team und Kölsch</strong></p>
          <p class="brand-subtitle">Interaktive Köln-Tour</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="score-pill" aria-live="polite">
        Punkte: <span id="header-score">0</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="quiz-root" tabindex="-1">
    <div id="progress-area" class="progress-shell hidden" aria-label="Tourfortschritt">
      <div class="progress-labels">
        <span id="progress-label">Start</span>
        <span id="progress-percent">0 %</span>
      </div>
      <div
        class="progress-track"
        role="progressbar"
        aria-valuemin="0"
        aria-valuemax="100"
        aria-valuenow="0"
        aria-labelledby="progress-label"
      >
        <div id="progress-fill" class="progress-fill"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <nav id="station-navigation" class="station-nav hidden" aria-label="Stationsnavigation"></nav>

    <section id="screen" class="screen" aria-live="polite"></section>

    <div class="footer-actions">
      <button id="reset-tour" class="danger full" type="button">
        Tour zurücksetzen
      </button>
    </div>
  </main>

  <div id="confetti-layer" class="confetti-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <script>
    "use strict";

    /* =========================
       Quizdaten
       ========================= */

    const STATIONS = [
      {
        id: 1,
        name: "Päffgen",
        category: "Köln-Fragen"
      },
      {
        id: 2,
        name: "Brunne von Kölle",
        category: "Medizin und Krankenhaus"
      },
      {
        id: 3,
        name: "Zappes",
        category: "Team und Persönlichkeit"
      }
    ];

    const KNOWLEDGE_QUESTIONS = {
      1: [
        {
          text: "Was befindet sich auf der „Schäl Sick“?",
          options: ["Ehrenfeld", "Deutz", "Lindenthal", "Nippes"],
          correct: 1,
          explanation: "„Schäl Sick“ ist die kölsche Bezeichnung für die rechtsrheinische Seite Kölns. Deutz liegt rechts des Rheins."
        },
        {
          text: "Warum heißt das Kölner Bier Kölsch?",
          options: [
            "Weil es ursprünglich ausschließlich in der Kölner Altstadt gebraut wurde",
            "Weil Kölsch eine geschützte Bezeichnung für Bier aus Köln und der zugelassenen Umgebung ist",
            "Weil es traditionell nur mit Kölner Quellwasser gebraut wird",
            "Weil der Begriff erstmals im Kölner Karneval verwendet wurde"
          ],
          correct: 1,
          explanation: "Kölsch ist eine geschützte Bezeichnung, die an die Herkunft und eine bestimmte Brauart gebunden ist."
        },
        {
          text: "Wie viele Kölschgläser müsste man ungefähr stapeln, um die Höhe des Kölner Doms zu erreichen?",
          options: ["etwa 105", "etwa 1.050", "etwa 10.500", "etwa 105.000"],
          correct: 1,
          explanation: "Grobe Schätzung: 157 Meter geteilt durch 0,15 Meter ergibt ungefähr 1.047 Gläser. In der Praxis wäre der Stapel natürlich nicht stabil."
        },
        {
          text: "Wenn Köln eine Krankenhausabteilung wäre, welche wäre es?",
          options: ["Notaufnahme", "Psychiatrie", "Freizeitmedizin", "Karnevalsambulanz"],
          fun: true,
          explanations: [
            "Notaufnahme passt: Köln ist lebhaft, spontan und irgendwie immer im Einsatz.",
            "Psychiatrie gewählt: Köln hört zu, bleibt offen und hält auch ungewöhnliche Ideen aus.",
            "Freizeitmedizin klingt nach einer sehr kölschen Fachrichtung mit hervorragender Work-Life-Balance.",
            "Karnevalsambulanz ist vermutlich spätestens ab dem 11.11. im Dauereinsatz."
          ]
        }
      ],
      2: [
        {
          text: "Wofür steht die Abkürzung „OP“ im Krankenhaus meistens?",
          options: ["Operationssaal", "Organisationsplan", "Orientierungsprüfung", "Ordnungspunkt"],
          correct: 0,
          explanation: "Im Krankenhaus steht „OP“ meistens für den Operationssaal beziehungsweise den Operationsbereich."
        },
        {
          text: "Welches Gerät erstellt Schnittbilder des Körpers mithilfe von Röntgenstrahlen?",
          options: ["EKG", "CT", "Ultraschallgerät", "Stethoskop"],
          correct: 1,
          explanation: "Die Computertomografie nutzt Röntgenstrahlen, um detaillierte Schnittbilder zu erzeugen."
        },
        {
          text: "Welche Station betreut normalerweise besonders schwer erkrankte oder frisch operierte Patientinnen und Patienten besonders engmaschig?",
          options: ["Intensivstation", "Cafeteria", "Verwaltung", "Physiotherapie"],
          correct: 0,
          explanation: "Auf einer Intensivstation werden besonders schwer erkrankte oder frisch operierte Menschen engmaschig überwacht und behandelt."
        },
        {
